		<pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2015 18:03:29 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=5610#comment-27059</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Sad that we have gotten to the point where we are celebrating a peak in the 80s and a 2nd week in the 90s. lol  Alas its not Madonna&#039;s fault.  It simply comes down to something as dumb as her age and radio not playing her because of it.  Rebel Heart is one of the best albums of her career and radio shows it no love, even though all the singles so far 100% fit on the current top 40 format.  Oh well.  As if Madonna has anything left to prove anyway.  All female artists will reach this point in their career (if they manage to still have a massive career like Madonna has at 57) where radio will move on to them as well....Unless society gets over this ageist bigotry by then.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Sad that we have gotten to the point where we are celebrating a peak in the 80s and a 2nd week in the 90s. lol  Alas its not Madonna&#039;s fault.  It simply comes down to something as dumb as her age and radio not playing her because of it.  Rebel Heart is one of the best albums of her career and radio shows it no love, even though all the singles so far 100% fit on the current top 40 format.  Oh well.  As if Madonna has anything left to prove anyway.  All female artists will reach this point in their career (if they manage to still have a massive career like Madonna has at 57) where radio will move on to them as well&#8230;.Unless society gets over this ageist bigotry by then.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
